@Loan_Management_System_HostAddress = http://localhost:5164

### 1. Swagger UI & OpenAPI Specification
GET {{Loan_Management_System_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### 2. List Delinquent Accounts
GET {{Loan_Management_System_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/delinquent?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Audit Logs
GET {{Loan_Management_System_HostAddress}}/api/v1/audit/logs?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create Loan Application (requires Idempotency-Key)
POST {{Loan_Management_System_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d

{
  "organizationId": "org_default",
  "borrowerId": "bor_001",
  "productId": "prod_personal_01",
  "requestedAmount": 25000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "tenorMonths": 24,
  "annualInterestRate": 12.50,
  "purpose": "Home Improvement",
  "collateralDescription": "Vehicle"
}
